2. Limitation

   You may not provide the Licensed Work to third parties on a hosted or
   embedded basis in order to compete with LiveContext's paid version(s)
   of the Licensed Work.

   A "competitive offering" is a product or service that is offered to
   third parties on a paid basis, including through paid support
   arrangements, that significantly overlaps with the capabilities of
   LiveContext's paid version(s) of the Licensed Work, such as the hosted
   service available at https://livecontext.ai.

   "Embedded" means including the source code or executable code of the
   Licensed Work in a competitive offering, or packaging the competitive
   offering in such a way that the Licensed Work must be accessed or
   downloaded for the competitive offering to operate.

   Operating the Licensed Work so that third parties can use it, on any
   infrastructure, including infrastructure they own or rent, is providing
   it to them on a hosted basis.

   If your use of the Licensed Work does not comply with the requirements
   of this License, you must obtain a commercial license from the
   Licensor, its affiliated entities, or authorized resellers, or you
   must refrain from using the Licensed Work. For information about
   alternative licensing arrangements, please contact oss@livecontext.ai.

